<title>CHINA: TRADING IN SILVER GRANT SHARES SUSPENDED.</title>
<headline>TRADING IN SILVER GRANT SHARES SUSPENDED.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in shares of Silver Grant International Industries Ltd was suspended on Friday at the request of the company pending an announcement, the Hong Kong stock exchange said.</p>
<p>The stock closed HK$0.30 lower at HK$4.80 on Thursday. -- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6345</p>
